---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy - Zenith Edge Journal"
  description="Privacy Policy and data protection terms for Zenith Edge Journal readers and visitors."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-6 mb-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-2">
        Last updated: September 2026
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
      <p>
        At Zenith Edge Journal, accessible from our domain, one of our main priorities is the privacy of our visitors. This Privacy Policy document outlines the types of information that is collected and recorded by our platform and how we use it.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Log Files</h2>
      <p>
        Zenith Edge Journal follows standard logging procedures. These logs include Internet Protocol (IP) addresses, browser type, Internet Service Provider (ISP), date/time stamps, referring/exit pages, and number of clicks. These are not linked to any information that is personally identifiable.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Cookies and Web Beacons</h2>
      <p>
        Like any other website, Zenith Edge Journal uses 'cookies'. These cookies are used to store information including visitors' preferences, and the pages on the website that the visitor accessed or visited.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Google DoubleClick DART Cookie & Third-Party Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        Google is one of a third-party vendor on our site. It also uses cookies, known as DART cookies, to serve ads to our site visitors based upon their visit to our site and other sites on the internet. Visitors may choose to decline the use of DART cookies by visiting the Google ad and content network Privacy Policy at the following URL: <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Advertising Partners Privacy Policies</h2>
      <p>
        Third-party ad servers or ad networks use technologies like cookies, JavaScript, or Web Beacons that are used in their respective advertisements and links that appear on Zenith Edge Journal. They automatically receive your IP address when this occurs. Zenith Edge Journal has no access to or control over these cookies that are used by third-party advertisers.
      </p>

      <h2>5. CCPA & GDPR Data Protection Rights</h2>
      <p>
        We would like to make sure you are fully aware of all of your data protection rights. Every user is entitled to request access, rectification, erasure, and restriction of personal data processing under applicable jurisdictions.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Consent</h2>
      <p>
        By using our website, you hereby consent to our Privacy Policy and agree to its Terms and Conditions.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
